01:49:09.129 --> 01:49:10.497
Benar-benar memek yang bagus.

01:49:22.609 --> 01:49:23.777
Kontolnya, jangan sampai kena kasur.

01:49:26.613 --> 01:49:29.783
Iya, ini kontolnya. Turun saja pelan-pelan begitu.

01:49:36.289 --> 01:49:37.290
Gosok.

01:49:42.763 --> 01:50:28.942
Sambil mainin tetek dan putingmu sendiri. Ya. Ada apa?

01:50:31.144 --> 01:50:33.547
Aku sudah tidak tahan.

01:50:38.184 --> 01:50:39.986
Kamu mau?

01:50:42.555 --> 01:50:44.391
Aku mau.

01:52:04.971 --> 01:52:07.707
Perutku sakit... Tunggu sebentar.

01:52:41.441 --> 01:52:43.376
Angkat lagi.

01:53:12.538 --> 01:53:14.607
Perutku sakit...

01:53:14.774 --> 01:53:15.875
Perutku sakit sekali.

01:53:21.848 --> 01:53:25.084
Perutku sakit.

01:53:41.033 --> 01:53:42.502
Angkat lagi.

01:53:49.509 --> 01:53:50.309
Angkat.

01:53:50.543 --> 01:53:50.943
Angkat.

01:53:51.144 --> 01:53:52.145
Angkat.

01:54:18.104 --> 01:54:19.705
Perutku sakit...

01:54:22.742 --> 01:54:23.743
Perutku sakit...

01:54:35.321 --> 01:54:37.690
Perutku sakit... Tetap begini saja.

01:56:35.007 --> 01:56:38.110
Sambil gerakkan pinggangmu sendiri dan mainin putingmu.

01:56:38.544 --> 01:56:39.545
Iya.

01:57:34.166 --> 01:57:39.404
Pink banget warnanya, aku bisa gila.

01:57:47.579 --> 01:57:50.282
Terlalu nikmat, aku bisa gila. Apa aku memang ingin disakiti?

01:57:52.918 --> 01:57:53.919
Sakit?

01:57:54.119 --> 01:57:55.087
Iya. 

01:57:55.087 --> 01:57:58.924
Enak mana sama kontol suamimu?

01:58:01.360 --> 01:58:02.828
Kontol ini

01:58:05.264 --> 01:58:06.265
Mainkan putingmu sendiri.

01:58:59.117 --> 01:59:01.887
Apa kamu bahagia?

01:59:02.554 --> 01:59:04.022
Aku bahagia.

01:59:21.206 --> 01:59:22.974
Ayo, masukkan sekarang.

02:01:38.376 --> 02:01:40.745
Aku masukkan lagi ya.

02:02:10.875 --> 02:02:14.545
Sambil terus mainkan putingmu.

02:02:35.967 --> 02:02:40.104
Masih mau lagi ?

02:02:40.905 --> 02:02:41.906
Iya.

02:02:42.507 --> 02:02:44.142
Teruslah mainkan putingmu.

02:04:07.525 --> 02:04:09.894
Aku mau keluar lagi gara-gara puting ini.

02:04:10.695 --> 02:04:12.930
Aku bakal keluar lagi cuma karena puting.

02:04:28.779 --> 02:04:29.914
Sambil terus memainkan puting.
